{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev80800","label":"RED ASH"},"label":"First Meeting II","stage":null,"prev":"d_ex_redash_03_1","next":"d_ex_redash_03_3","speakers":{"Narration":"Narration","rapunzel_o":"Rapunzel","commander":"Commander","liliweiss":"Liliweiss","dorothy":"Dorothy"},"icons":{"Narration":"si_c999_00_s","rapunzel_o":"si_c966_00_s","commander":"si_c942_00_s","liliweiss":"si_c943_00_s","dorothy":"si_c233_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_1","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_1","text":"Record #003-2 playback.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"ArkRuinIndoor","bgArt":"arkruinindoor","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":["rapunzel_o","liliweiss","commander","dorothy"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_2","text":"My name's Rapunzel. I'm Grimms Model No. 3, and I have been assigned to the Goddess Squad.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_backtonormal","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_3","text":"I'm glad to be part of the team.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_4","text":"... What exactly are you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_5","text":"She looks like a nun.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_6","text":"Is that what you are?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_7","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_8","text":"Where did you say you came from?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_9","text":"I'm from V.T.C.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_10","text":"When you say V.T.C., do you mean the medical center operated by the church group?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_11","text":"Yes. That's correct.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_12","text":"Now that I think about it, your face looks kind of familiar.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_13","text":"Weren't you the leading candidate to assume the papacy?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_14","text":"I left all that behind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_15","text":"Why? You had such a bright future ahead of you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_16","text":"I couldn't bear to sit back watching all the suffering in this world and not do anything about it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_17","text":"Yet, despite my desire to stand up and do something, I found myself in an environment where human dignity had perished, and base survival was the driving force behind all decisions. I was powerless to do anything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_18","text":"That's when I heard about all of you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_19","text":"Stories circulated about how you all were a beacon of light bringing hope back into the world.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_20","text":"I wanted to be part of that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_21","text":"That's why I'm here. I wish to become a Goddess of Victory.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_22","text":"Faith alone will not get us through this trial. The time has come for us to take up arms.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_23","text":"That is why I was determined to be eligible for this program.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_24","text":"You speak like a Saint.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_25","text":"Truly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_26","text":"A holy warrior.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_27","text":"I'm looking forward to working with all of you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_28","text":"As are we.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_29","text":"May I ask what kind of skills you have?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_30","text":"Ah, yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_31","text":"I'm quite adept at praying. Once, I prayed continuously for three entire days without any rest.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_32","text":"I've also garnered praise for my preaching and public speaking engagements.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_33","text":"I even participated in the church choir.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_34","text":"Er...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_35","text":"I was referring more to your skills in battle.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_36","text":"Oh, my apologies.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_37","text":"The staff that I use has the power to regenerate Goddesium.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_38","text":"Goddesium?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_39","text":"Remind me what that is again?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_40","text":"It's what our bodies are all composed of.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_41","text":"I knew that! I was just testing to make sure you knew.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_42","text":"Sure you were.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_43","text":"Anyway, how is regenerating Goddesium out of thin air even possible?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_44","text":"To be more precise, I can replenish small amounts of Goddesium particles in damaged areas.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_45","text":"For example,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_46","text":"I would be able to undo the damage done by a gunshot.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_47","text":"So it's like filling up a hole? Wouldn't that negatively affect certain functions?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_48","text":"Not at all. I'm well versed in our internal structures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_49","text":"This knowledge was imparted to me during the process of becoming a Nikke.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_50","text":"I therefore know precisely what each individual part of our body requires in order to function normally.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_51","text":"So you're a healer as well?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_52","text":"A woman of many talents.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_53","text":"Indeed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_54","text":"So long as we've got you on our team, we can fight without a care in the world.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_55","text":"I would still urge you all to exercise caution in battle. I can heal certain injuries up to a point, but if the wounds are too severe, my powers won't be of much use.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_56","text":"I also have a beam distortion ability, and my hair also acts as a scrambler for certain electronics.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_57","text":"Although my physical prowess may not measure up to the rest of you,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_redash_03_2_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_redash_03_2_58","text":"I'll be able to provide you with adequate support and allow you to focus on the fight.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,